       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. QLNOT07.
      * CHARGE CHANGE - NOTICE PERIOD BEFORE APPLYING
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-RUN-COUNT              PIC 9(5) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-DAYS-OF-NOTICE         PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-APPLY-CHANGE           PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-DAYS-OF-NOTICE
           PERFORM 2000-CHANGE
           DISPLAY 'APPLY: ' WS-APPLY-CHANGE
           STOP RUN.
       2000-CHANGE.
      * CHANGES ARE PROSPECTIVE; ONE MONTH (30 DAYS) NOTICE MINIMUM.
           MOVE 'N' TO WS-APPLY-CHANGE
           IF WS-DAYS-OF-NOTICE >= 30
              MOVE 'Y' TO WS-APPLY-CHANGE
           END-IF
           ADD 1 TO WS-RUN-COUNT.
